	// Then browse it with `?u=<your address>`. `Reset` throws it away.
	//
	// ## Namespaces
	//
	// - [`demo`](/r/moul/x/plan9/ns/v1:ns?u=demo)
	//
	// Design and analysis: [moul/gno-contracts#136](https://github.com/moul/gno-contracts/issues/136).
